    {
      "id": 18,
      "type": "text",
      "title": "Why EnsureModelDownloaded is missing from the four panels above",
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 5,
        "w": 24,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 52
      },
      "options": {
        "mode": "markdown",
        "content": "`ModelService/EnsureModelDownloaded`, `ModelService/StreamModelFiles` and `Health/Watch` are **deliberately absent from the four gRPC panels above**.\n\nThey are streaming: the metrics layer's future resolves at stream setup, so recording them would report `outcome=\"ok\"` and a sub-millisecond duration for work that can run forty minutes and fail as a stream item. A confidently wrong number is worse than an absent one.\n\nThe in-flight gauge excludes them too, so a running `EnsureModelDownloaded` shows up in no gRPC panel at all -- use **Downloads in flight** in Overview for that, and the **Downloads** row for its latency, from `mx_download_seconds`."
      }
    },
